  "about.mission.heading": "Our mission",
  "about.mission.body": "DARE collects, preserves and shares African scholarship, research publications, datasets and educational resources. We centre African voices and knowledge systems, keep provenance and licensing transparent, and make knowledge freely discoverable, citable and reusable.",
